    "text": "By Jerry Dargan ,\n18 hours ago HIALEAH, FL – A former sales representative at a local jewelry store was arrested Monday after allegedly using dozens of forged checks to steal nearly $50,000 from her employer. The Fraud Scheme. Geydis Cabrera, 39, faces multiple charges, including third-degree grand theft, uttering a forged instrument, and organized fraud. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
